		(property "Sourcing_Note" "500R is not an E24 value, so this is a 0.1% thin-film part at $0.25. For a series damping resistor a 5% 510R (RC0603JR-07511RL) would do the same job for about $0.01. It has a second job now the ring runs at 5V: when RING_EN is low the ring board's level shifter is unpowered, and this resistor limits the current into its input clamp if firmware drives NEOPIX high while the ring is off."
			(at 34.29 29.21 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
