		(property "Sourcing_Note" "BNO086 replaces the deprecated BNO085. Same 28-LGA 5.2x3.8x1.1 mm package, identical pinout and SH-2/SHTP software feature set (BNO08X datasheet rev 1.17), so no schematic or layout change. Adds an on-die temperature sensor, 14-bit accelerometer fusion, lower idle power and Interactive Calibration. Footprint field still names the IC_BNO085 library footprint, which is the same land pattern."
			(at 114.3 97.79 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
