		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Vdrive on 1-3, RING_EN on 4, GND on 5, 6, 8, 9, NEOPIX on 7, NEOPIX_RET on 10. Mates with J10 on the ring board. Pin 4 was a fourth Vdrive way until the ring moved to a 5V boost; it now carries the enable for the ring's boost converter, driven from U1 P1.00. Three ways still carry Vdrive, about 370mA at full white."
