		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Bulk capacitance on the main-board end of the ring cable. Works with FB1 as an LC filter so the ring boost's 1MHz input ripple does not travel back onto +BATT, and gives the cable's inductance something local to work against. The boost's own 10uF input capacitor (C62) sits on the ring board next to U9, where the datasheet wants it."
